 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Two metering paths",
   "items": [
    "The harness's own model calls go through the gateway thread of the launcher (source gateway in llm.jsonl)",
    "spawn_agent sub-agents call the provider directly from the MCP process (source spawn_agent)",
    "Both reserve the worst case first, so parallel calls cannot overrun the LLM cap"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Caps",
   "items": [
    "LLM: 402 from the gateway, a stopped sub-agent from agent.py",
    "Cloud: creation refused under cloud_lock when the budget would overrun",
    "After deliver: spend frozen, a small grace for the harness to finish its turn"
   ]
  }
 ]
}